WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.179 --> 00:00:06.299
so Donald Trump delivered a completely bizarre
and self-congratulatory and very deranged

00:00:06.299 --> 00:00:12.180
graduation speech at West Point over the weekend,
it was riddled with a failed applause lines.

00:00:12.180 --> 00:00:17.640
But most notably, at one point, Donald Trump
visibly struggled to raise a glass of water

00:00:17.640 --> 00:00:22.619
to his mouth and later struggled to walk down
a ramp, almost having to be helped down the

00:00:22.619 --> 00:00:24.500
ramp by a member of the military.

00:00:24.500 --> 00:00:27.210
Now I'm going to show you the video and we're
we're going to talk about it.

00:00:27.210 --> 00:00:32.970
But this is as much a story about right wing
hypocrisy as it is a story about Donald Trump's

00:00:32.970 --> 00:00:34.940
cognitive and physical state.

00:00:34.940 --> 00:00:38.980
If Joe Biden did 20 percent of what Trump
did at this speech over the weekend, it would

00:00:38.980 --> 00:00:40.820
be a week of Fox News in 08.

00:00:40.820 --> 00:00:46.460
And agit trash about Joe Biden has dementia,
with Judge Jeanine bringing in someone whose

00:00:46.460 --> 00:00:51.270
cousin's girlfriend once went to medical school
to say that Joe Biden is unfit to lead.

00:00:51.270 --> 00:00:53.110
If this was Hillary, it would be Hillary.

00:00:53.110 --> 00:00:55.500
Parkinson's times 10 all over again.

00:00:55.500 --> 00:01:00.500
And yet here they are pretending like there's
just nothing to see here other than so-called

00:01:00.500 --> 00:01:02.290
Trump derangement syndrome.

00:01:02.290 --> 00:01:06.860
And by the way, Trump derangement syndrome
is a term that the right has developed to

00:01:06.860 --> 00:01:09.320
not have to address criticisms of Donald Trump.

00:01:09.320 --> 00:01:10.710
You say something about Trump.

00:01:10.710 --> 00:01:12.700
You have Trump derangement syndrome.

00:01:12.700 --> 00:01:14.200
It's a way to stop conversation.

00:01:14.200 --> 00:01:19.250
So, first of all, at one point during the
speech, Donald Trump goes to drink water,

00:01:19.250 --> 00:01:23.560
picks up a glass with his right hand, brings
it about 80 percent of the way to his lips.

00:01:23.560 --> 00:01:26.830
His right hand seemingly could go no higher.

00:01:26.830 --> 00:01:31.590
He tries moving his mouth down to bring it
down enough to get to the glass.

00:01:31.590 --> 00:01:32.590
Couldn't do it.

00:01:32.590 --> 00:01:37.939
And eventually uses his left hand to very
strangely pull the glass towards his mouth

00:01:37.939 --> 00:01:39.159
and tilt it.

00:01:39.159 --> 00:01:44.799
It wasn't clear if the problem was with Trump's
right arm, with his hand eye coordination.

00:01:44.799 --> 00:01:46.540
We just have no idea.

00:01:46.540 --> 00:01:48.310
But this is not a normal way to drink water.

00:01:48.310 --> 00:01:52.619
And it's the second time, at least that we've
seen Donald Trump bizarrely drink water in

00:01:52.619 --> 00:01:53.840
this way.

00:01:53.840 --> 00:01:57.479
Then the other sort of most notable moment
during the speech was Trump descending the

00:01:57.479 --> 00:02:02.860
ramp at the end of the speech, very gingerly,
carefully, like he was about to fall over.

00:02:02.860 --> 00:02:03.910
Very strange.

00:02:03.910 --> 00:02:08.420
And then he took a sort of hop step at the
bottom of the ramp, which he later described

00:02:08.420 --> 00:02:12.180
as jogging down the last 10 feet, which we'll
get to.

00:02:12.180 --> 00:02:16.769
You'll also notice that the officer gesturing,
gesturing for Trump to leave the stage and

00:02:16.769 --> 00:02:22.749
then walking next to him implies that the
officer was briefed ahead of time.

00:02:22.749 --> 00:02:24.760
Stay with Trump going down the ramp.

00:02:24.760 --> 00:02:30.079
So, again, we've seen Trump come off of Air
Force One, sometimes with the help of an aide.

00:02:30.079 --> 00:02:32.129
We've seen various versions of this.

00:02:32.129 --> 00:02:35.659
He just doesn't look stable when he's walking
here.

00:02:35.659 --> 00:02:39.129
So is this the most important thing going
on right now?

00:02:39.129 --> 00:02:40.129
It's not.

00:02:40.129 --> 00:02:44.870
But again, if this was Joe Biden, it would
be a week on right wing media about how this

00:02:44.870 --> 00:02:47.609
