00:03:17.559 --> 00:03:20.669
I ran to down to ground level.

00:03:20.669 --> 00:03:21.949
That's also a lie.

00:03:21.949 --> 00:03:24.809
Trump sort of took a two step hop.

00:03:24.809 --> 00:03:26.919
